{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=May 2018}}
'''Group 3 of the [[1950 FIFA World Cup]]''' took place from 25 June to 2 July 1950. The group consisted of [[Sweden men's national football team|Sweden]], [[Italy national football team|Italy]], [[Paraguay national football team|Paraguay]], and [[India national football team|India]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/worldcup/news/y=2013/m=12/news=brazil-first-world-cup-draw-2238709.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140614002515/http://www.fifa.com/worldcup/news/y=2013/m=12/news=brazil-first-world-cup-draw-2238709.html |url-status=dead |archive-date=14 June 2014 |title=Brazil's first World Cup draw |date=3 December 2013 |publisher=FIFA}}</ref> However, India later withdrew from the group.<ref name="yfittopostblog">{{cite web|url=http://in.yfittopostblog.com/2010/06/14/barefoot-in-bengal-and-other-stories/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100614204013/http://in.yfittopostblog.com/2010/06/14/barefoot-in-bengal-and-other-stories/|url-status=dead|archive-date=14 June 2010|title=Fit to Post: Yahoo! India News - Blog Archive Barefoot in Bengal and Other Stories |accessdate=22 May 2018}}</ref> The group winners advanced to the [[1950 FIFA World Cup#Final round|final round]].

